```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Launch Classical Cryptography Toolkit]) --> InitUI[Initialize Tkinter Graphical User Interface]
    InitUI --> DisplayMenu[Display Main Navigation Menu\nOptions 1 to 13]

    DisplayMenu --> Choice{User Selection}

    %% Section 1: Substitution Ciphers
    Choice -->|Options 1 to 6| SubCiphers[Substitution Ciphers\nCaesar, Monoalphabetic, Playfair, Hill, Vigenere, OTP]
    SubCiphers --> InputData[Input Plaintext & Key]
    InputData --> ValidateKey{Validate Key & Input\nvia validators.py}
    ValidateKey -->|Invalid| ShowError[Display Detailed Validation Error]
    ShowError --> InputData
    ValidateKey -->|Valid| ExecuteCipher[Execute Modular Arithmetic / Matrix / Keystream]
    ExecuteCipher --> MeasureTime[Record Execution Latency in ms]
    MeasureTime --> DisplayOutput[Render Output Ciphertext / Decrypted Text]

    %% Section 2: Transposition Ciphers
    Choice -->|Options 7 to 8| TransCiphers[Transposition Ciphers\nRail Fence, Columnar Transposition]
    TransCiphers --> InputTrans[Input Text & Key Depth/Keyword]
    InputTrans --> ValidateTrans{Validate Key & Rails}
    ValidateTrans -->|Invalid| ShowError
    ValidateTrans -->|Valid| PermuteGrid[Reorder Characters via Zigzag or Column Permutation]
    PermuteGrid --> MeasureTime

    %% Section 3: Algorithm Comparison
    Choice -->|Option 9| CompareEngine[Algorithm Comparison Engine\ncomparison.py]
    CompareEngine --> SelectMulti[Select Ciphers & Benchmark Text]
    SelectMulti --> BenchmarkLoop[Iterate through Ciphers:\nTime Encrypt & Decrypt\nVerify Round-Trip Integrity]
    BenchmarkLoop --> RenderTable[Populate Treeview Comparison Table\nDisplay Execution Latency & Expansion]

    %% Section 4: File Operations
    Choice -->|Options 10 & 11| FileIO[Text File Encryption / Decryption\nfile_operations.py]
    FileIO --> OpenFileDialog[Prompt User via Open File Dialog]
    OpenFileDialog --> ValidateEncoding{UTF-8 & Non-Empty?}
    ValidateEncoding -->|Error| ShowError
    ValidateEncoding -->|Valid| PreviewSource[Preview File Content]
    PreviewSource --> ProcessFile[Apply Selected Cipher Algorithm]
    ProcessFile --> PreviewProcessed[Preview Ciphertext Output]
    PreviewProcessed --> SaveAsDialog[Prompt Save As... Output File Dialog]
    SaveAsDialog --> WriteSafe[Safely Write to Destination File\nPrevent Accidental Overwrite]

    %% Section 5: Help & Exit
    Choice -->|Option 12| ShowHelp[Render Educational Theory & Mathematical Formulas]
    Choice -->|Option 13| ExitApp[Confirm Exit Dialog & Clean Up Resources]
    ExitApp --> End([Application Terminated])

    DisplayOutput --> DisplayMenu
    RenderTable --> DisplayMenu
    WriteSafe --> DisplayMenu
    ShowHelp --> DisplayMenu
```
